Petra opens a ledger. "Your name, your belongings. No one else's account touches yours."
+ [How does storage work?]
    "I can hold sixty item slots and your gold. Choose exactly how much to deposit or withdraw. Worn weapons keep their condition in storage."
    -> END
+ [Can I store equipped gear?]
    "Unequip it here in town first. If your pack is full, make room before you take anything out. I never accept half a transfer."
    -> END
+ [Is my gold safe if I fall in Alby?]
    "Yes. Neither your banked gold nor the gold you carry is lost on defeat. Elara will see you home."
    -> END
